Once you enter your username and password and click Sign In:
	1.	You will receive a One-Time Password (OTP) by email.
	2.	Look for an email with the subject:
“Your Verification Code for SDL”
	3.	Enter the 6-digit OTP on the screen.
	4.	Click Verify Code.

